&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About CookUnity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Food has lost its soul to modern convenience. And with it, it has lost the power to nourish, inspire, and connect us. So in 2018, CookUnity was founded as the first-of-its-kind platform that connects the world with the source of truly great food: chefs. Today, CookUnity delivers 50 million meals a year from the industry’s best chefs to homes all over the country. Fresh. Ready-to-eat. And crafted with the passion that nourishes body and soul.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Unwilling to stop there, CookUnity is expanding beyond delivery to become an ever-innovating marketplace focused on our singular mission: &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;empower Chefs to nourish the world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;If that mission has you hungry in more ways than one, you’ve found the right job posting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a skilled Commercial Kitchen Service Technician to join our dynamic team. The&lt;br&gt;ideal candidate will have a strong background in servicing and maintaining commercial kitchen&lt;br&gt;equipment, plumbing, and performing general maintenance. Refrigeration knowledge is a plus.&lt;br&gt;This role requires a keen attention to detail, excellent problem-solving abilities, and a willingness&lt;br&gt;to help in all areas of maintenance when needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Perform routine maintenance and inspections of commercial kitchen equipment to&lt;br&gt;ensure optimal functionality and safety.&lt;br&gt;● Diagnose and troubleshoot equipment malfunctions, identifying root causes and&lt;br&gt;implementing effective solutions in a timely manner.&lt;br&gt;● Conduct repairs and replacements of faulty components, including electrical,&lt;br&gt;mechanical, and plumbing systems.&lt;br&gt;● Install new equipment according to manufacturer specifications, ensuring proper&lt;br&gt;alignment, connectivity, and operational efficiency.&lt;br&gt;● Maintain accurate records of service, parts usage, and equipment status for reporting.&lt;br&gt;● Adhere to all safety protocols and regulations while working on-site or in the workshop.&lt;br&gt;● Collaborate with internal teams to coordinate repairs, parts orders, and service&lt;br&gt;schedules.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;● Proven experience as a Commercial Kitchen Service Technician or similar role,&amp;nbsp;preferably in a fast-paced service environment.&lt;br&gt;● Strong knowledge of commercial kitchen equipment, including but not limited to gas and&amp;nbsp;electric appliances, HVAC systems, and plumbing fixtures, and refrigeration.&lt;br&gt;● Technical proficiency in troubleshooting and repairing mechanical, electrical, and&amp;nbsp;electronic systems.&lt;br&gt;● Familiarity with reading technical manuals, schematics, and diagrams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;● Excellent communication skills with the ability to interact professionally with team&amp;nbsp;members.&lt;br&gt;● Strong organizational skills and attention to detail to ensure thorough documentation and efficient service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;● Completion of technical school program in HVAC, electrical, refrigeration, or related field&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;● Able to stand or walk for 8-10 hours a day and carry up to 50 pounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;● Occasionally be required to work in a cold refrigerated area kept at 35 degrees Fahrenheit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and Certification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● High school diploma or equivalent; completion of a technical school program in HVAC,&amp;nbsp;electrical, refrigeration, or a related field is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Relevant certifications such as CFESA (Commercial Food Equipment Service Association), EPA, or similar credentials are a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Health Insurance coverage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌅&amp;nbsp;401k Plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⛱ Paid sick days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌟&amp;nbsp;Awesome opportunity to join a company that is looking to change how we eat and how chefs work!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Compensation&lt;/h3&gt;
All final pay rates will be determined by candidates experience, knowledge, skills, and abilities of the applicant, internal equity, and alignment with market data.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range for this position&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$24&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$27 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re interested in this role, please submit your application, and if we think you might be a fit, we&#39;ll get in touch with you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Thank you for your time!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CookUnity is an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;. We are dedicated to creating a community of inclusion and an environment free from discrimination or harassment. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, citizenship status, protected veteran status, genetic information, or physical or mental disability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
